{"version":1,"key":"article:56","content":{"id":56,"title":"Z变换解差分方程的思考","author":"","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"98b301a0-290f-478d-8a83-b3481970411b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"问题描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ce30ce91-a2ed-43c5-912e-6d5470884527","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"今日碰到一道差分方程的题目，如下"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"y(n + 2) - \\dfrac{7}{10}y(n + 1) + \\dfrac{1}{10}y(n) = 7x(n+2) -2 x(n + 1)","collabId":"8448d0dc-df08-4784-a57c-6eac32d8d410","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9912bd2f-a738-4500-a8e8-ddf8521fa415","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"已知 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"x(n) = \\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^n u(n)","collabId":"9bb8d652-1589-4726-b1da-93f7020ced16","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x(n) = \\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^n u(n)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"y(0) = 2","collabId":"4ab39c1d-b2da-47d9-98dd-10518c40f183","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y(0) = 2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"y(1) = 4","collabId":"68719ccb-227d-4a43-9e57-e74f3f780285","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y(1) = 4"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，求全响应。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c6c6473b-cb84-460f-8cc2-81d4004a22fa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一般求解这种题目的思路很清晰，首先根据特征方程求出特征根，从而得出零输入解的形式，但是这个时候给的条件是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"y(0)","collabId":"8b883caf-7de4-44be-8296-90b1d089be8c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y(0)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"y(1)","collabId":"b8d473c9-296c-4f35-b579-e3366d32c190","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y(1)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，而不是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"y_{zi}(0)","collabId":"1bb01873-9af1-479e-a0b4-708094a46645","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y_{zi}(0)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"y_{zi}(1)","collabId":"c3b8d88a-e9fc-43ea-9051-41e7216c60e4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y_{zi}(1)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这意味着此时我们不能直接得出零输入解的系数。这个时候我们可以求出系统的零状态响应，然后可以得出 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"y_{zs}(0)","collabId":"77cdc398-d87b-4a54-8004-8bf87b8169f3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y_{zs}(0)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"y_{zs}(1)","collabId":"534af2fd-e695-4bd1-930a-c24c0806cd1e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y_{zs}(1)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，然后根据 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"y_{zi}(0) = y(0) - y_{zs}(0)","collabId":"c29b1f6a-423d-4dac-9f6b-9cb4116cf91d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y_{zi}(0) = y(0) - y_{zs}(0)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"y_{zi}(1) = y(1) - y_{zs}(1)","collabId":"fc746663-0e62-4b3a-bebb-073f02e23217","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y_{zi}(1) = y(1) - y_{zs}(1)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，然后得出零输入响应的系数，然后将零输入响应和零状态响应相加得到全响应。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"51e34d14-db67-4884-a1b2-c5c5c21cd617","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的思路很清晰，但是却是有点麻烦，我们可以根据"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nZ\\{y(n + 2) \\} &= z^2(Y(z) - y(0) - y(1)z^{-1}) \\\\\\\\\nZ\\{y(n + 1) \\} &= z(Y(z) - y(0))\n\\end{aligned}","collabId":"7855e24f-e790-4a94-8faf-a1507042138f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9f22cce7-126d-4f16-9601-0a43e87e0b8e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对上面同时进行 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"Z","collabId":"fb9bc823-0e27-43d1-ac9a-41825617ff73","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Z"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 变换"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"z^2(Y(z) - y(0) - y(1)z^{-1}) - \\dfrac{7}{10}z(Y(z) - y(0)) + \\dfrac{1}{10}Y(z) = 7z^2X(z) - 2zX(z)","collabId":"2c8cf9ed-fb78-4395-b1eb-fa1ab583ab7b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ec653232-53f0-4317-8565-aa39279084ad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的式子是我在答案(不一定正确的答案)上看到的，但是你没有发现有没有一丝丝的不对，怎么"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"Z\\{x(n + 2)\\} = z^2X(z) \\neq z^2(X(z) - x(0) - x(1)z^{-1})","collabId":"d9a9f6a8-33a5-4c68-873f-8ce9807a8670","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9a85e79b-76a7-4f24-8417-98e8b97aab00","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那么问题来了，哪种是对的呢?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0a892130-2526-4b25-88b0-25531ad325cc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我认为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"Z\\{x(n + 2)\\} =  z^2(X(z) - x(0) - x(1)z^{-1})","collabId":"b31e53f8-df45-4d28-b1dd-c95fb7e485b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Z\\{x(n + 2)\\} =  z^2(X(z) - x(0) - x(1)z^{-1})"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是对的。但是我们经常见到好像是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"Z\\{x(n + 2)\\} = z^2X(z)","collabId":"65611c05-a2a4-410c-9491-3965034ef449","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Z\\{x(n + 2)\\} = z^2X(z)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的形式，这是怎么回事，这是因为在课本上我们见到的都是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"y(n - n_0), x(n - n_0)","collabId":"1092b2d9-82db-449e-bc78-6f443fc798fb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"y(n - n_0), x(n - n_0)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这种后向差分的形式，因为这时做 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"Z","collabId":"20ee5020-4c42-4d01-b4d8-a737b6c429b0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Z"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 变换与 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"x(-n_0)","collabId":"48077750-c99d-41e9-92df-137e7fb48484","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x(-n_0)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 有关，而 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"x(n) = 0 , n < 0","collabId":"7c17a593-0417-470e-847e-63525183aca1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x(n) = 0 , n < 0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以后面就没有长长的\"尾巴\"。我们将上面的差分方程改写为"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"y(n) - \\dfrac{7}{10}y(n - 1) + \\dfrac{1}{10}y(n - 2) = 7x(n) -2 x(n - 1)","collabId":"9f7b42c6-0e9e-4e32-9044-f4ddd2c52ada","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1dd60d3f-1f66-4948-bc8e-ec66c7dbad46","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后对两边进行 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"Z","collabId":"43151742-0eca-406c-bf6f-4dc74d74a935","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Z"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 变换得到"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"Y(z) - \\dfrac{7}{10}z^{-1}(Y(z) + y(-1)z) + \\dfrac{1}{10}z^{-2}(Y(z) + y(-1)z + y(-2)z^2) = 7X(z) - 2z^{-1}X(z)","collabId":"866fde43-d92e-4785-a92f-e9619b911621","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a747b981-87a3-4b89-a039-35ea41ee7600","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"x(-1) = x(-2) = 0","collabId":"d8525120-702f-48de-9cdf-7ca0c89c83c5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x(-1) = x(-2) = 0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以后面就没有\"尾巴\"，然后两边同时乘以 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"z^2","collabId":"0b20874e-1b17-4ba1-8d0b-20b8e848302f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"z^2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 得到"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"z^2Y(z) - \\dfrac{7}{10}z(Y(z) + y(-1)z) + \\dfrac{1}{10}(Y(z) + y(-1)z + y(-2)z^2) = 7z^2X(z) - 2zX(z)","collabId":"9b62337b-d926-4dec-8a41-87df13e33a59","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"de4f0182-3b3d-4455-a55e-c9e3e7b98b18","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"求证想法"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e99188ef-b6ef-49d0-ab4f-0ed07f9d7108","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了验证我的说法，这里使用最前面提到的方法(分别求零输入和零状态)和上面我的想法求解，看看答案是否一致，如果一致的话，说明我的想法是正确的。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"dfc322c8-e0d7-4216-8978-c3f499118f75","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解法一"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2442fddc-679a-48c3-9d29-68be49137a6b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由特征方程"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"r^2 - \\dfrac{7}{10}r + \\dfrac{1}{10} = (r - \\dfrac{1}{2})(r - \\dfrac{1}{5}) = 0 \\Rightarrow r = \\dfrac{1}{2},\\dfrac{1}{5}","collabId":"5106d3cc-95ec-44b9-ab0a-553d8956862a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e66e1960-8c7b-45bf-816c-e9bf4e994791","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"于是设零输入响应的解为"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"y_{zi}(n) = C_1 \\left( \\dfrac{1}{2} \\right)^nu(n) + C_2 \\left( \\dfrac{1}{5} \\right)^nu(n)","collabId":"d0128d42-27ea-4bdb-9845-e5522236cbca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f3ed03ba-25af-4914-b35b-1e7acbcd515a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由差分方程知"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"H(z) = \\dfrac{7z^2 - 2z}{(z - \\dfrac{1}{2})(z - \\dfrac{1}{5})}","collabId":"5c22376e-8b0b-44f4-a9bb-f5cfc7517c2c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"09c0f6b0-8763-49c7-b9cd-cade95e00c92","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"又"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"X(z) = \\dfrac{z}{z - \\dfrac{1}{2}}","collabId":"7140094f-a97d-4388-a81c-b6f773b10ceb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a4e19afd-2f92-46f8-b0c6-763b48a2aa57","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"故"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"Y(z) = H(z)X(z) = \\dfrac{z(7z^2 - 2z)}{(z - \\dfrac{1}{2})^2(z - \\dfrac{1}{5})} = \\dfrac{5}{2} \\dfrac{z}{(z - \\dfrac{1}{2})^2} + \\dfrac{25}{3}\\dfrac{z}{z - \\dfrac{1}{2}} - \\dfrac{4}{3} \\dfrac{z}{z - \\dfrac{1}{5}}","collabId":"f1583ed2-b403-400f-bacf-fa0fc0115c1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2a9bed06-f2af-44bc-996f-758c4cb929f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"则"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"y_{zs}(n) = 5n\\left( \\dfrac{1}{2} \\right)^nu(n) + \\dfrac{25}{3}\\left( \\dfrac{1}{2} \\right)^nu(n) - \\dfrac{4}{3}\\left( \\dfrac{1}{5} \\right)^nu(n)","collabId":"a5fc03b0-0ce2-4c1d-b519-b6a9d06033d1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"52e1e81a-7c87-4db9-b179-1c46024f59fa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"则"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\begin{aligned}\ny_{zi}(0) &= C_1 + C_2 &= y(0) - y_{zs}(0) &= -5 \\\\\\\\\ny_{zi}(1) &= \\dfrac{1}{2}C_1 + \\dfrac{1}{5}C_2 &= y(1) - y_{zs}(1) & = -\\dfrac{12}{5}\n\\end{aligned}","collabId":"7d35fb36-9efd-4dea-bdff-fbeda6ec2b75","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"46158dd6-f454-4f45-8c62-c6bab126cebc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"得到"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nC_1 &= -\\dfrac{14}{3} \\\\\nC_2 &= -\\dfrac{1}{3}\n\\end{aligned}","collabId":"ec6b6125-d0c8-4cbc-867d-ed8a17232fcf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a68eb6ff-1c96-48ea-b7f6-3fc38a823724","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"则"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"y_{zi}(n) = -\\dfrac{14}{3} \\left( \\dfrac{1}{2} \\right)^nu(n) -\\dfrac{1}{3} \\left( \\dfrac{1}{5} \\right)^nu(n)","collabId":"845499a3-fae0-4102-9db0-9f404c0b8e43","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"f65f768b-341e-44ac-8d85-a5599e507a86","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解法二"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"y(n + 2) - \\dfrac{7}{10}y(n + 1) + \\dfrac{1}{10}y(n) = 7x(n+2) -2 x(n + 1)","collabId":"3e1f2d84-40f7-41d6-998e-92b295d0e766","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"38bcb7c9-b162-4276-82cd-49ae5c5cbac2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"两边同时求 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"Z","collabId":"184a5c31-874e-45d7-a2cc-c019608f2d18","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Z"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 变换"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"z^2(Y(z) - y(0) - y(1)z^{-1}) - \\dfrac{7}{10}z(Y(z) - y(0)) + \\dfrac{1}{10}Y(z) = 7z^2(X(z) - x(0) - x(1)z^{-1}) - 2z(X(z) - x(0))","collabId":"32c023a4-8a87-455d-8b90-13452dd5f226","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"13104fae-7977-44d7-8892-cb4d4cda303d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"得到"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"Y(z) = \\dfrac{(y(0) - 7x(0))z^2 + (y(1) - \\dfrac{7}{10} y(0) - 7x(1) + 2x(0))z}{(z - \\dfrac{1}{2})(z - \\dfrac{1}{5})} + H(z)X(z)","collabId":"90c95420-535f-4743-b241-a329c14b5692","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"86fae06e-0c17-4cc2-aafc-3eec56002a97","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可知"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nY_{zi}(z) \\\\\n& = \\dfrac{(y(0) - 7x(0))z^2 + (y(1) - \\dfrac{7}{10} y(0) - 7x(1) + 2x(0))z}{(z - \\dfrac{1}{2})(z - \\dfrac{1}{5})} \\\\ \n& = \\dfrac{-5z^2 + \\dfrac{11}{10}z}{(z - \\dfrac{1}{2})(z - \\dfrac{1}{5})} \\\\\n& = -\\dfrac{14}{3}\\dfrac{z}{z - \\dfrac{1}{2}} - \\dfrac{1}{3}\\dfrac{z}{z - \\dfrac{1}{5}}\n\\end{aligned}","collabId":"029a5b28-8553-4851-8b66-e0b965778525","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7bb3a998-e2cf-45ee-aabc-f19797a7244e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"y_{zi}(n) = -\\dfrac{14}{3} \\left( \\dfrac{1}{2} \\right)^nu(n) -\\dfrac{1}{3} \\left( \\dfrac{1}{5} \\right)^nu(n)","collabId":"8f4e5aef-e961-456a-8a46-29fce7f62785","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"afc2aced-e564-4325-b244-a065d24a4a8d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"同第一种解法一样，所以我的想法是正确的(小声BB答案错了)。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"a804db51-b6a8-45a1-8c7c-88b4dcd4249b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"总结"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6f7f00e7-82f0-4f7b-a7ae-a336955d73b6","children":[{"type